  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>Moment of inertia of solid sphere<br />\t\t\tof radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> about any tangent.</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>Moment of inertia of hollow sphere of radius<br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>R</mi></mfenced></math> about any tangent.</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>Moment of inertia of circular ring of radius<br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>R</mi></mfenced></math> about its diameter.</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>Moment of inertia of circular disc of radius<br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>R</mi></mfenced></math> about any diameter.</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
